OL,3,GNEWSA'Fantastic news for world's
OL,4,Alargest Bronte collection'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to create a new storage
OL,7,Ffacility for the world's largest
OL,8,Fcollection of Bronte-related material
OL,9,Fhas been given a #232,000 grant.
OL,11,FThe National Lottery Heritage Fund
OL,12,F(NHLF) money was awarded for the Bronte
OL,13,FParsonage Museum's Road to Resilience
OL,14,Fprogramme.
OL,16,FThe plan also involves the
OL,17,Ftransformation of nearby historic
OL,18,Fbuildings in Haworth and the
OL,19,Fappointment of a part-time project
OL,20,Fcurator.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
